                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 (Potsdam)/7–2945</note>
                <head>No. 1343<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Text Submitted by the Soviet
                        Delegation</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1343-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-29">July 29, 1945</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">On Syria and Lebanon</hi></p>
                <p>On the Soviet Government suggestion at the Conference [there] took place the
                    exchange of opinions on the situation in Syria and Lebanon.</p>
            </div>
